ONERULER — MIT License
https://github.com/mungg/OneRuler

Yekyung Kim, Jenna Russell, Marzena Karpinska, Mohit Iyyer.
"One ruler to measure them all: Benchmarking multilingual long-context
language models." COLM 2025. arXiv:2503.01996

How it is used here:

  * `modal_kv_audit_v4.py --stage prepare-data` clones the ONERULER
    repository at run time and invokes its official generator to produce the
    niah_single and niah_none contexts. No ONERULER source or data is
    redistributed in this repository.

  * Portions of `modal_kv_audit_v4.py` are ported from ONERULER's evaluation
    code and per-language prompt data:

        compare_numbers()   official present-needle scorer
        compare_none()      official absent-needle scorer
        NONE_DICT           per-language "none" words

    These are ported to match the official scoring behavior and are used as
    the reference scorer. The strict and lenient variants defined alongside
    them (compare_none_strict, compare_numbers_lenient) are our own additions
    and are reported separately.

