================================================================================
Data in this repository

`results/` contains model outputs only: predictions, gold values, and per-item
metadata produced by running the models above over ONERULER-generated
contexts. It contains no haystack text. The contexts are regenerable with the
official ONERULER generator at its released defaults for these tasks
(book haystacks, 7-digit numeric values, seed 42, 32768 tokens).

The ONERULER haystacks are built from per-language books distributed with that
project; none of that text is redistributed here.


